{
    "title": "Hockey All Stars",
    "description": "Make your mark on the ice with Hockey All Stars! Put together a team of unstoppable players, Wind up those slap-shots, test out your poke checks, and seize victory in this must-play mobile hockey game!\r\n\r\nNATIONAL HOCKEY\r\nTake on the biggest teams in the USA in the Playoffs mode or dominate the ice and play against the best 20 national teams from around the World. Would your franchise win the trophy?\r\n\r\nCREATE A FRANCHISE\r\nTake your love of hockey to the next level by building and managing your very own hockey franchise! Customise your team uniform and start to establish your team on the World stage. Build your franchise through training your team or collecting player cards.\r\n\r\nONLINE LEAGUE\r\nTest your franchise and Take on teams from around the World in Weekly Online League tournaments. Battle it out, rise up the rankings and prove who has the best franchise! Could your team take home the silverware?\r\n\r\nCould your dream franchise have what it takes? Download Hockey All-Stars NOW!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n- Complete Hockey Sim\r\n- Create and build your own hockey franchise\r\n- Train your players to create a team of All-Stars\r\n- Improve your team by collecting player cards\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT\r\nThis game is free-to-play but does include optional in-app purchases, which can be purchased with real money.\r\n\r\nFIND US\r\nWEB: www.distinctivegames.com\r\nFACEBOOK: facebook.com/distinctivegames\r\nTWITTER: twitter.com/distinctivegame\r\nINSTAGRAM: www.instagram.com/distinctivegame\r\nYOUTUBE: youtube.com/distinctivegame",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make your mark on the ice with Hockey All Stars! Put together a team of unstoppable players, Wind up those slap-shots, test out your poke checks, and seize victory in this must-play mobile hockey game!<br><br>NATIONAL HOCKEY<br>Take on the biggest teams in the USA in the Playoffs mode or dominate the ice and play against the best 20 national teams from around the World. Would your franchise win the trophy?<br><br>CREATE A FRANCHISE<br>Take your love of hockey to the next level by building and managing your very own hockey franchise! Customise your team uniform and start to establish your team on the World stage. Build your franchise through training your team or collecting player cards.<br><br>ONLINE LEAGUE<br>Test your franchise and Take on teams from around the World in Weekly Online League tournaments. Battle it out, rise up the rankings and prove who has the best franchise! Could your team take home the silverware?<br><br>Could your dream franchise have what it takes? Download Hockey All-Stars NOW!<br><br>FEATURES<br>- Complete Hockey Sim<br>- Create and build your own hockey franchise<br>- Train your players to create a team of All-Stars<br>- Improve your team by collecting player cards<br><br>IMPORTANT<br>This game is free-to-play but does include optional in-app purchases, which can be purchased with real money.<br><br>FIND US<br>WEB: www.distinctivegames.com<br>FACEBOOK: facebook.com/distinctivegames<br>TWITTER: twitter.com/distinctivegame<br>INSTAGRAM: www.instagram.com/distinctivegame<br>YOUTUBE: youtube.com/distinctivegame",
